1
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:11,030
(Supported by NRTA's Online Audiovisual
Quality Creation & Distribution Project)

2
00:00:24,550 --> 00:00:29,530
♪Black hair twines around bone♪

3
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:35,360
♪Night dew cold♪

4
00:00:35,490 --> 00:00:39,750
♪Bronze mirror cracks
through three lifetimes♪

5
00:00:40,490 --> 00:00:44,040
♪Shines on the sleepless♪

6
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:48,580
♪Yunmeng Marsh ebbs and flows♪

7
00:00:49,050 --> 00:00:52,730
♪Vows sink deep♪

8
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:58,360
♪White-hair curse turns to snow♪

9
00:00:58,400 --> 00:01:03,170
♪Covering the realm♪

10
00:01:07,530 --> 00:01:11,020
=Reunion Across Time=

11
00:01:11,050 --> 00:01:14,080
=Episode 6=

12
00:01:18,719 --> 00:01:20,640
(Why did she give this to me?)

13
00:01:21,760 --> 00:01:22,840
(This father and daughter...)

14
00:01:23,280 --> 00:01:24,760
(What secret are they hiding?)

15
00:01:29,120 --> 00:01:30,079
(Strange.)

16
00:01:30,920 --> 00:01:33,200
(This aura feels so familiar.)

17
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:04,040
(The auras of these two things...)

18
00:02:04,519 --> 00:02:05,719
(Why are they so alike?)

19
00:02:07,319 --> 00:02:08,719
(Could they share the same origin?)

20
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:16,120
Wanniang,

21
00:02:16,919 --> 00:02:17,960
wait for me a little longer.

22
00:02:20,639 --> 00:02:21,319
Father,

23
00:02:24,479 --> 00:02:25,159
will Mother

24
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:28,240
really come back?

25
00:02:29,599 --> 00:02:30,560
She will. I'm certain.

26
00:02:34,879 --> 00:02:35,840
By then,

27
00:02:36,560 --> 00:02:37,199
will I...

28
00:02:38,919 --> 00:02:40,120
Will I still be here?

29
00:02:50,479 --> 00:02:51,319
Father,

30
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:54,759
if this can

31
00:02:55,439 --> 00:02:57,159
fulfill your wish,

32
00:02:58,960 --> 00:02:59,840
I will

33
00:03:01,039 --> 00:03:02,800
die without regret.

34
00:03:50,840 --> 00:03:51,639
What are you trying to do?

35
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:54,479
When we swap bodies,

36
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:55,639
you'll find out.

37
00:03:56,639 --> 00:03:57,599
I won't hide it from you anymore.

38
00:04:04,919 --> 00:04:06,360
You touched one of
Zhong Jiang's clay figures?

39
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:08,199
How did you know?

40
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:10,080
Why can't you ever listen?

41
00:04:10,479 --> 00:04:11,680
Why did you go to him?

42
00:04:14,280 --> 00:04:15,159
Do you remember

43
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:16,959
the bamboo slip we found

44
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:18,120
under that dead tree
at the foot of the mountain?

45
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:20,399
In Zhong Jiang's shop,

46
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:22,319
I sensed the same aura.

47
00:04:22,439 --> 00:04:23,240
So what?

48
00:04:23,759 --> 00:04:25,639
You knew it was dangerous
and still went near him.

49
00:04:26,199 --> 00:04:27,680
That counts as merit.

50
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:30,959
You knew all along something
was wrong with Zhong Jiang, didn't you?

51
00:04:32,639 --> 00:04:33,680
How did you know?

52
00:04:34,079 --> 00:04:36,160
Who exactly is Zhong Jiang?

53
00:04:36,759 --> 00:04:38,480
What's the use of talking about it now?

54
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:40,800
I'll take you to him.

55
00:04:46,560 --> 00:04:47,480
How can this be?

56
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:50,680
I'll send men to find him.

57
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:52,079
No.

58
00:04:52,439 --> 00:04:53,040
I'll handle it.

59
00:05:04,480 --> 00:05:05,959
Zhong Jiang went to the brick kiln
west of the city.

60
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:07,800
So that's where he went.

61
00:05:10,040 --> 00:05:10,720
Daughter,

62
00:05:11,199 --> 00:05:12,879
you'll see your mother soon.

63
00:05:21,879 --> 00:05:22,839
Diviner Song.

64
00:05:27,639 --> 00:05:29,639
Pretty lady, you...

65
00:05:30,199 --> 00:05:31,600
You came to play with me.

66
00:05:32,639 --> 00:05:33,279
You two...

67
00:05:34,160 --> 00:05:35,240
What are you doing?

68
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:37,040
This is my business.

69
00:05:37,800 --> 00:05:38,759
None of your concern.

70
00:05:39,399 --> 00:05:40,160
Get out!

71
00:05:41,079 --> 00:05:42,279
Don't be afraid, miss.

72
00:05:43,759 --> 00:05:44,399
I...

73
00:05:45,439 --> 00:05:47,279
I'll soon get to see

74
00:05:48,079 --> 00:05:49,399
my mother.

75
00:05:50,800 --> 00:05:52,000
Come play with me,

76
00:05:52,639 --> 00:05:53,639
won't you?

77
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:56,279
Zhong Jiang,

78
00:05:56,759 --> 00:05:58,240
you'd actually use your own daughter

79
00:05:58,560 --> 00:06:00,000
for clay-figure soul molding?

80
00:06:02,959 --> 00:06:03,759
I'll soon...

81
00:06:05,120 --> 00:06:07,120
I'll soon bring Wanniang back.

82
00:06:09,079 --> 00:06:10,079
I will never...

83
00:06:10,920 --> 00:06:12,759
never let anyone stop me!

84
00:06:14,040 --> 00:06:15,240
How did you come by this method?

85
00:06:15,600 --> 00:06:16,600
Who told you?

86
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:20,319
Since you've found out,

87
00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:22,360
neither of you

88
00:06:24,839 --> 00:06:25,959
is leaving here today.

89
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:34,319
Watch out!

90
00:06:34,600 --> 00:06:35,399
I'll handle them.

91
00:07:15,199 --> 00:07:16,680
Using the living
to mold a soul for the dead...

92
00:07:17,199 --> 00:07:18,079
This is a dark art

93
00:07:18,399 --> 00:07:19,639
the Shaman Clan banned long ago.

94
00:07:20,279 --> 00:07:21,800
How did you learn this method?

95
00:07:22,439 --> 00:07:24,120
Heaven wants me to see Wanniang again.

96
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:26,000
How could I not seize it?

97
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:28,040
What I seek

98
00:07:28,240 --> 00:07:29,160
is none of your business.

99
00:07:29,800 --> 00:07:30,920
Why stop me?

100
00:07:32,639 --> 00:07:34,120
You'd trade your own daughter's life

101
00:07:34,439 --> 00:07:35,560
for your wife's?

102
00:07:36,199 --> 00:07:37,079
Have you lost your mind?

103
00:07:37,920 --> 00:07:38,879
I'm willing.

104
00:07:44,079 --> 00:07:45,839
All these years since Mother left,

105
00:07:47,079 --> 00:07:48,920
Father has been full of regret and pain.

106
00:07:50,160 --> 00:07:51,759
I miss my mother too.

107
00:07:53,360 --> 00:07:55,360
I share blood with her.

108
00:07:56,519 --> 00:07:58,000
I'm the best vessel.

109
00:07:59,680 --> 00:08:00,600
I'm willing.

110
00:08:01,439 --> 00:08:02,399
Those whose souls are molded

111
00:08:02,839 --> 00:08:04,399
endure piercing pain every day.

112
00:08:04,959 --> 00:08:06,680
You can't possibly bear such suffering.

113
00:08:10,439 --> 00:08:11,120
Wan,

114
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:13,000
trust me.

115
00:08:13,920 --> 00:08:14,800
It's almost done.

116
00:08:14,959 --> 00:08:16,000
It's almost done.

117
00:08:16,759 --> 00:08:17,600
Trust me.

118
00:08:19,079 --> 00:08:20,199
Even if she comes back,

119
00:08:20,839 --> 00:08:22,360
she'll never be reincarnated again.

120
00:08:22,959 --> 00:08:24,439
Her soul may even dissipate completely.

121
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:26,439
Everything you've done

122
00:08:26,959 --> 00:08:28,160
will be for nothing.

123
00:08:29,360 --> 00:08:31,279
For someone who may no longer exist,

124
00:08:31,920 --> 00:08:33,159
you'd sacrifice your daughter's life.

125
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:35,159
Is it worth it?

126
00:08:36,279 --> 00:08:37,679
Whether it's worth it
is for me to decide.

127
00:08:38,840 --> 00:08:41,039
I... I will bring Wanniang back.

128
00:08:41,679 --> 00:08:42,320
Wan,

129
00:08:43,039 --> 00:08:44,559
I'll bring you back too.

130
00:08:45,159 --> 00:08:45,919
Trust me.

131
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:47,440
Trust me, alright?

132
00:08:49,799 --> 00:08:50,679
She can't come back!

133
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:51,759
Shut up!

134
00:08:52,919 --> 00:08:54,120
Keep meddling,

135
00:08:54,639 --> 00:08:56,360
and I'll make you Wan's vessel.

136
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:07,759
You...

137
00:09:08,240 --> 00:09:09,159
You know martial arts?

138
00:09:11,399 --> 00:09:12,639
You're the one who saved me that night?

139
00:09:14,120 --> 00:09:14,960
Miss Chu Li,

140
00:09:15,440 --> 00:09:17,039
now's not the time for reminiscing.

141
00:09:18,360 --> 00:09:20,080
Clay-figure soul molding:
the soul-molding core

142
00:09:20,440 --> 00:09:21,480
is on Zhong Jiang's body.

143
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:23,279
In that case,

144
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:25,679
I'll clear the way for you.

145
00:10:02,879 --> 00:10:03,600
Miss,

146
00:10:04,799 --> 00:10:06,039
I'm willing to give my life

147
00:10:06,559 --> 00:10:07,759
to bring my mother back.

148
00:10:08,600 --> 00:10:09,639
Spare my father,

149
00:10:10,399 --> 00:10:11,240
please.

150
00:10:13,039 --> 00:10:14,320
Your mother can't come back.

151
00:10:15,039 --> 00:10:16,120
Don't be a fool.

152
00:10:16,759 --> 00:10:17,799
Once the dark art begins,

153
00:10:18,039 --> 00:10:19,399
you can only become a sacrifice.

154
00:10:19,639 --> 00:10:20,679
There's no way back.

155
00:10:21,600 --> 00:10:22,399
She really

156
00:10:23,360 --> 00:10:24,639
can't come back?

157
00:10:32,480 --> 00:10:33,279
Miss,

158
00:10:33,840 --> 00:10:35,399
can you help me then?

159
00:10:35,919 --> 00:10:36,960
I'm in so much pain.

160
00:10:38,399 --> 00:10:39,879
I don't have much time left.

161
00:10:40,799 --> 00:10:42,720
I don't want to be tormented like this
anymore.

162
00:10:43,600 --> 00:10:44,799
Help me.

163
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:46,840
I really can't hold on.

164
00:10:47,759 --> 00:10:48,799
It hurts so much.

165
00:11:02,360 --> 00:11:03,080
Wan.

166
00:11:03,600 --> 00:11:04,639
Don't hurt my daughter.

167
00:11:05,080 --> 00:11:06,399
Don't hurt my daughter!

168
00:11:10,679 --> 00:11:12,480
No!

169
00:11:18,360 --> 00:11:19,279
I'm sorry.

170
00:11:20,679 --> 00:11:21,840
I can't save you.

171
00:11:23,279 --> 00:11:24,919
I can only end your pain.

172
00:11:31,879 --> 00:11:33,240
Thank you, miss.

173
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:38,759
Father,

174
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:42,840
I'm sorry.

175
00:11:49,919 --> 00:11:50,919
What a pity.

176
00:11:52,159 --> 00:11:54,799
I haven't seen the sun in so long.

177
00:12:34,360 --> 00:12:35,360
Wan...

178
00:12:47,559 --> 00:12:49,240
I'll kill you.

179
00:12:50,440 --> 00:12:52,720
I'll kill you!

180
00:13:24,879 --> 00:13:25,799
Wan,

181
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:30,919
I failed you.

182
00:13:33,440 --> 00:13:34,879
I'm truly sorry.

183
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:41,799
Our family of three

184
00:13:43,279 --> 00:13:45,480
can finally be together again.

185
00:14:07,200 --> 00:14:08,320
Now we're in trouble.

186
00:14:11,120 --> 00:14:12,200
With Zhong Jiang dead,

187
00:14:12,759 --> 00:14:14,720
I need to find another craftsman
to meet the deadline.

188
00:14:16,039 --> 00:14:16,840
What a hassle.

189
00:14:20,480 --> 00:14:21,799
That's not the way back.

190
00:14:22,120 --> 00:14:22,919
Where are you going?

191
00:14:23,559 --> 00:14:25,799
Zhong Jiang, an ordinary craftsman,

192
00:14:26,360 --> 00:14:28,200
actually knew
the Shaman Clan's forbidden art.

193
00:14:28,559 --> 00:14:29,399
Something's off.

194
00:14:29,840 --> 00:14:31,600
I'm going to check his brick kiln.

195
00:14:32,159 --> 00:14:33,080
Miss Chu Li,

196
00:14:33,639 --> 00:14:35,200
always so concerned for the realm.

197
00:14:36,679 --> 00:14:37,799
Diviner Song,

198
00:14:38,519 --> 00:14:40,120
save your sarcasm.

199
00:14:41,440 --> 00:14:43,279
Please record today's events
in the register.

200
00:14:43,759 --> 00:14:44,759
This counts as merit, doesn't it?

201
00:14:45,759 --> 00:14:47,399
The day I become Grand Shaman

202
00:14:47,639 --> 00:14:48,480
shouldn't be far off now.

203
00:14:49,480 --> 00:14:50,039
Fine.

204
00:14:50,639 --> 00:14:52,759
Then I'll go pick a fight
with the Grand Shaman right now

205
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:54,080
and make her step down for you.

206
00:14:55,480 --> 00:14:56,120
Sure.

207
00:14:56,320 --> 00:14:57,000
Go ahead.

208
00:14:58,320 --> 00:14:59,399
You really have the heart to do that?

209
00:14:59,799 --> 00:15:00,600
Of course.

210
00:15:03,120 --> 00:15:04,120
By the way, Diviner Song,

211
00:15:05,200 --> 00:15:06,799
I never knew a civil official like you

212
00:15:07,120 --> 00:15:08,360
had such skill in combat.

213
00:15:10,320 --> 00:15:11,679
Were you

214
00:15:12,720 --> 00:15:14,000
just pretending before?

215
00:15:15,480 --> 00:15:16,200
How did you know

216
00:15:16,200 --> 00:15:17,480
Zhong Jiang's clay figures were off?

217
00:15:17,879 --> 00:15:19,120
Why did you cover your face
when you saved me?

218
00:15:19,879 --> 00:15:21,519
Why pretend
you didn't know martial arts?

219
00:15:22,159 --> 00:15:23,360
Song Ziyuan, explain yourself!

220
00:15:26,399 --> 00:15:27,039
It's a secret.

221
00:15:27,399 --> 00:15:28,000
You...

222
00:15:29,559 --> 00:15:30,879
Sooner or later,
I'll uncover your secret

223
00:15:30,879 --> 00:15:32,480
and see what kind of man you really are!

224
00:15:34,550 --> 00:15:38,076
(Family Heirloom)

225
00:15:44,960 --> 00:15:45,639
It's inside.

226
00:16:06,399 --> 00:16:07,000
Song Ziyuan,

227
00:16:08,240 --> 00:16:09,000
there's a hidden passage here.

228
00:16:21,650 --> 00:16:28,400
♪Night rain falls in the courtyard,
shining on mortal partings♪

229
00:16:28,810 --> 00:16:35,480
♪Strangers meet again,
past lives gleam in endless hues♪

230
00:16:35,850 --> 00:16:39,170
♪A sharp arrow pierces memory♪

231
00:16:39,340 --> 00:16:42,540
♪Longing spreads like dye♪

232
00:16:42,870 --> 00:16:49,530
♪Beaded curtains
keep love and hate apart♪

233
00:16:49,950 --> 00:16:56,610
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

234
00:16:56,900 --> 00:17:03,260
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪

235
00:17:03,430 --> 00:17:06,860
♪That year,
pear blossoms, verse, and laughter♪

236
00:17:07,120 --> 00:17:10,340
♪One night, snow fell in wild flurries♪

237
00:17:10,380 --> 00:17:17,260
♪All perfection in this world
hides regret♪

238
00:17:17,610 --> 00:17:21,140
♪A drop of heart's blood seals love♪

239
00:17:21,300 --> 00:17:24,860
♪No more longing enters dreams♪

240
00:17:25,260 --> 00:17:31,700
♪When all turns to mist,
may you and I be safe forever♪

241
00:18:00,610 --> 00:18:07,280
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

242
00:18:07,530 --> 00:18:13,820
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪
